As a Digital Project Manager for the BeNeLux region, you will lead digital projects across Belgium and the Netherlands, from initial scoping through to launch and user adoption.

You will translate business needs into practical digital solutions while ensuring compliance with quality, privacy, security, legal and regulatory requirements.

You will also contribute to and lead the BeNeLux Artificial Intelligence roadmap, including the identification of use cases, employee training and the sharing of best practices across the organisation.

Main responsibilities

