Managing and prioritising the BeNeLux digital project portfolio;
Overseeing digital platforms, channels and performance;
Leading the BeNeLux Artificial Intelligence roadmap;
Identifying and supporting relevant Artificial Intelligence use cases;
Organising training and sharing digital and Artificial Intelligence best practices;
Ensuring compliance with quality, privacy, security, legal and regulatory requirements;
Coordinating projects with business teams, technology partners, users and external suppliers;
Collaborating with local BeNeLux teams and Global colleagues.
Your profile

