Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in a relevant field;
Relevant experience in digital project management or digital transformation;
Experience coordinating different stakeholders, suppliers and project deadlines;
Knowledge of digital platforms, analytics or Artificial Intelligence;
Experience in a regulated sector would be an advantage;
Fluent English is required.
Skills and competencies
Strong project management and prioritisation skills;
Ability to manage stakeholders and communicate clearly;
Analytical, user-centred and pragmatic approach to problem-solving;
Strong interest in digital innovation and Artificial Intelligence;
Ability to support change and user adoption;
Ability to deliver training and share best practices;
Collaborative mindset and ability to work across different countries and functions.
Key working relationships

You will collaborate with a wide range of stakeholders across the BeNeLux organisation and Global teams, including Business Unit Managers, Sales Managers, Brand Managers, Finance colleagues and digital and omnichannel stakeholders.

